","role":"present"},{"entity_id":"cod-fardc","role":"present"}],"source_ids":[49,53]}],"sources":{"49":{"url":"https://monusco.unmissions.org/sites/default/files/2026-08/BCNUDH-Analyse%20de%20la%20situation%20des%20droits%20de%20l%27homme-mois%20de%20juin%202026.pdf","title":"BCNUDH - Analyse de la situation des droits de l'homme, juin 2026","publisher":"UNJHRO / MONUSCO","date":"2026-08"},"51":{"url":"https://actualite.cd/2023/04/21/bas-uele-frontieres-poreuses-activisme-des-rebelles-seleka-eleveurs-mbororo-et-balaka-la","title":"Bas-Uele: frontieres poreuses, activisme des rebelles Seleka, eleveurs Mbororo et Balaka","publisher":"Actualite.cd","date":"2023-04-21"},"50":{"url":"https://actualite.cd/2024/06/03/rdc-des-rebelles-centrafricains-signales-dans-les-territoires-dango-et-de-bondo","title":"RDC: des rebelles centrafricains signales dans les territoires d'Ango et de Bondo","publisher":"Actualite.cd","date":"2024-06-03"},"52":{"url":"https://news.mongabay.com/2024/08/herders-caught-between-conflict-and-climate-change-in-the-northern-congo-basin/","title":"Herders caught between conflict and climate change in the northern Congo Basin","publisher":"Mongabay","date":"2024-08"},"53":{"url":"https://monusco.unmissions.org/sites/default/files/2026-07/UNJHRO_rapport_mai.pdf","title":"UNJHRO rapport mensuel, mai 2026","publisher":"UNJHRO / MONUSCO","date":"2026-07"}},"units":{"CD5206-bondo":"Bondo territory (Bas-Uele) lies far from eastern DRC's active conflicts; UNJHRO classes Bas-Uele among provinces not affected by armed conflict in 2026. Historic threats - LRA incursions, armed Mbororo herders and CAR rebels (ex-Seleka/UPC) crossing from Zemio/Mboki, last widely reported in 2023-2024 - have not translated into territorial control by any group. Bondo town and all rural secteurs (Bondo, Bili, Monga) are assigned to state control (PNC, with thin FARDC presence along the CAR border) by default state presence, with low confidence in the remote Bili and Monga border areas."}}